# The hosted Academy function needs only the dependency-light UI layer, the page
# and the shared composition contract. Everything else is either too heavy for a
# serverless bundle (FAISS memory, the A2A stack), irrelevant to it (tests,
# recorded proofs, the second Vercel project), or local-only.
.venv/
.git/
.github/
tests/
proofs/
sandbox/
deploy/
s13code/core/
s13code/main.py
s13code/cli.py
s13code/planner.py
s13code/runtime.py
s13code/routes.py
s13code/a2a_routes.py
s13code/gateway.py
s13code/tools.py
uv.lock
*.log
*.sqlite
__pycache__/
